{
    "hotel": {
        "name": "Citadines Place d'Italie Paris",
        "strapline": "Apartments in Paris",
        "description": "<p>Perfectly located at the heart of the buzzing Place d'Italie and adjacent to its shopping centre, this aparthotel guarantees direct and rapid access to all the capital's iconic locations. Whether it's for a long stay or a city break, you will appreciate the easy access to the Place de l'Etoile, Bastille or Châtelet–Les Halles. Situated in the south of Paris, Citadines Place d'Italie Paris enjoys a location that perfectly sums up the dynamic vision of a new Paris that self-defines as a clever blend of tradition and modernity, of little streets imbued with history and spaces that are wide open to the imagination. The apartments ooze this vision also with modern furnishings flaunting bright statement colours and being equipped with all the necessary conveniences you may need to feel right at home. This is a beautiful place to explore Paris from.</p>",
